WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:02.880
- This video was made
possible by Tab For A Cause.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.900
Raise money for charity
just by opening tabs

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.430
which you were going to do anyway.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:07.630
Link in the description.

00:00:11.166 --> 00:00:13.166
(sighs)

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:16.300
So what's new?

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.520
It's actually really weird
recording from my own kitchen.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.850
Feels like I would have
a Peter McKinnon-style

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:25.731
coffee montage, but I don't
really drink coffee that much.

00:00:25.731 --> 00:00:28.731
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:32.749 --> 00:00:35.499
(water dribbles)

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:44.620
So, I've never seen anything like this.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:48.340
I graduated from law school in 2008,

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:49.830
right in the middle of the recession,

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.830
and you can imagine
that joining a big firm

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:55.780
in the middle of what was until now

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.140
the worst recession that
we had seen in modern times

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:02.790
was a very dramatic time to
become a practicing lawyer.

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:06.550
That is nothing compared
to what it seems like

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:08.180
we're in the middle of right now.

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:11.140
I'm from Los Angeles, but
for the last five years,

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:13.590
I have lived in DC, and I consider myself

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:17.280
a Washingtonian now,
and I'm really worried

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:21.679
because I go to the same gym as Rand Paul.

00:01:21.679 --> 00:01:23.640
(chuckles nervously)

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.170
I'm gonna get some crap for that.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:28.180
But I thought that because
things are so crazy

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:30.330
and so up in the air, people might want

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:31.650
an update from Legal Eagle.

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.520
What does this mean for the channel?

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:36.580
And frankly, because we're all basically

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:40.060
stuck at our houses, my hope is that

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:43.160
the channel will more or less
continue as it always has.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:46.800
I find it incredibly rewarding that people

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:51.410
turn to my channel for
entertainment and education.

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:54.180
Right now, I think we
could all use a little bit

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.170
more information about the world,

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:59.370
especially the legal world
that we're surrounded by,

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:01.700
and also a little entertainment

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.330
and a little light-hearted
fun from time to time.

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:06.210
The power of attorney!

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:08.700
I get a lot of joy out of
making these videos for people.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:11.950
I find it very rewarding
when I get nice comments

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:15.700
in the comments section, and
when people leave bad comments,

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:16.800
your hatred fuels me.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:19.440
So for the most part,
I'm really just going to

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:21.580
try and continue as I always have

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:24.620
with real legal work sort of drying up

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:27.730
because the courts are
more or less closed,

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:30.130
I'm gonna try and
increase video production.

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:32.140
It's usually one video
a week on this channel,

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:33.910
I'm gonna try for at least two.

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:37.253
I'm going to keep all of my staff going,

00:02:37.253 --> 00:02:39.105
I think it's the least that I could do

00:02:39.105 --> 00:02:43.484
in times when we don't know
what's going to happen,

00:02:43.484 --> 00:02:47.440
at least those privileged
few who can work from home,

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:50.200
I'm going to do my part
to try to make sure

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.850
that those people get a paycheck,

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:54.100
and there are a fair number
of people that rely on me,

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:56.370
on this channel and the work that I do,

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.150
and I feel like I owe it to them

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:59.880
to try and continue that work.

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:03.680
Oh, and this is an issue for another day,

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:07.670
but I have a super secret legal
project that I'm working on

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:10.890
that predates all of this
crazy coronavirus stuff.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.740
Man, I can't wait to
tell you what's going on.

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:16.630
It involves a law suit, and
it may involve the government.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.770
This could be a really,
really interesting thing,

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:19.730
but that's gonna have to wait

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:21.840
until things are a little bit more solid,

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.540
and it's more in progress,

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.040
but I can't wait to tell you about it.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:27.370
So that's an update from
Legal Eagle the channel,

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:30.430
but I suppose that since we're
in this intimate setting,

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:33.550
we might as well do an
update from Devin personally.

00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:36.320
What I intend to do personally is

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.160
whatever I can to keep things going,

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.810
to try and make things a little bit better

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:42.380
for those people especially
in the service industry

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:45.009
that can't simply work from home.

00:03:45.009 --> 00:03:48.220
I'll probably be thanking
my delivery people

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:50.720
like they are soldiers
returning home from war.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.860
On YouTube, I'm gonna try and help out

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:54.590
as many creators as I possibly can.

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:57.410
I would love to do some
collabs with people,

00:03:57.410 --> 00:03:59.180
especially smaller channels,

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:01.790
people that are perhaps
interested in the law

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:05.040
but might not be in the
legal sector in particular,

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:07.010
though I'm certainly open to working with

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:09.000
other legal creators as well.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.910
Obviously charities are a huge thing.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:13.160
We need to band together
to be able to help

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:16.640
the less fortunate, those
who are really being affected

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:19.920
by this coronavirus isolation quarantine,

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:23.340
and what seems like an
inevitable economic downturn.

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:25.690
For example, this video you'll find a link

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:27.560
to Tab For A Cause, which has been

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:29.860
a long time supporter of this channel.

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:32.300
It's great because they're teaming up with

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:35.740
a bunch of coronavirus-specific
related charities,

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:37.510
and it's great because all you have to do

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:40.540
is install a Chrome
extension and do surfing,

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.810
which I think we're all
going to be doing a lot of

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:44.170
web surfing these days.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:46.410
Just generates ad revenue that's donated

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:49.350
to whatever charities
that you direct it to.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.610
Additionally, with
increased video production,

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:53.540
I'll probably have some
additional opportunities

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:58.370
to partner with charities to
directly sponsor the channel.

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:00.000
We can take all of the proceeds

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.100
and donate it to various
effective charities.

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:05.650
So those of you that are
out there in the comments,

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.670
if you could leave me some suggestions

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:10.400
on which charities I should partner with,

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:12.610
I would greatly appreciate being able to

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:16.790
be directed to the most
effective charities

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:20.110
to be able to combat
the coronavirus threat.

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:22.480
I think that there are a lot of people

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:24.160
doing a lot of good work out there.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:26.580
We owe an enormous debt of gratitude

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:29.490
to doctors, nurses,
and other medical staff

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:32.760
that are out there that are on
the front lines of this thing

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:34.710
and they're literally risking their lives

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:35.840
to help everyone else.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:40.060
So in terms of being able
to do what I can as a lawyer

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:44.480
with very minimal, (chuckles)
to put it graciously,

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:46.450
very minimal medical training,

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.620
I would like to be able to help

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.540
those that are on the front lines.

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.730
And in terms of what I intend
to do with my free time

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:55.890
now that we all have a lot of free time,

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:57.650
well I think like most people,

00:05:57.650 --> 00:06:00.010
I'm looking forward to
cooking a lot of meals

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:03.370
in this kitchen where I
spend a lot of of my time.

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:05.640
I'm looking forward to
doing a whole lot of

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:07.450
body weight workouts here at home.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:09.630
I'm looking forward to bettering myself

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:12.570
and doing a lot of e-learning.

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:15.460
As I'm sure long-time
viewers of the channel know,

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:18.271
Legal Eagle is sponsored by
companies like Skillshare

00:06:18.271 --> 00:06:20.480
and Brilliant, and there's
a good reason for it.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.500
There are companies out there
where I don't necessarily

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.617
agree with their mission.

00:06:25.617 --> 00:06:26.800
(coughs) Raid Shadow Legends.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:29.730
But it's really easy to work
with companies like Skillshare

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:31.920
and Brilliant because I really
believe in their mission,

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:34.670
and I believe in people getting better

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:37.370
by learning the things that are necessary

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.390
and then practicing that on their own,

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:41.830
and these kind of e-learning platforms

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.390
allow us a wealth of knowledge that

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:47.750
we wouldn't have had even 10 years ago.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:49.530
So like everybody else, I'm gonna learn

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:50.920
a lot of new skills.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:53.600
Maybe this is too personal,
but I'm a really bad dancer,

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:56.100
so I think I'd like to learn how to dance,

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.630
especially when no one's looking.

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:59.590
So if you have any tips on where I can go

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:02.390
to learn some dance moves online,

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:05.540
leave them in the comments
and I'd appreciate it.

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:07.470
You know, I think with some of this time,

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:09.450
I'll be on social media more.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.670
So if you follow me on Twitter,

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:14.590
I will probably be trying
to avoid going stir crazy

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:18.597
by venting my frustrations
on Twitter and Instagram,

00:07:18.597 --> 00:07:22.300
and you know, I don't
feel like now is really

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:24.470
the right time to start a Patreon,

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:28.140
but maybe if there was something
that I could really add

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:29.790
to the community that you guys wanted,

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:31.680
and maybe if the proceeds from the Patreon

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:36.220
went to my staff, for example,
or some other charity,

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.450
I would be open to it.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.310
If there's something that I can do

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:44.058
to get better acquainted with
all the Legal Eagles out there

00:07:44.058 --> 00:07:47.930
and people who are interested
in the law, I'm open to ideas.

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:52.850
So let's end with some
optimism and some thankfulness.

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:54.960
Let's end with a couple of the things

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:57.030
that I'm actually really
looking forward to

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:01.410
about this whole isolation
and quarantine situation.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:03.630
Number one, I'm looking
forward to all of the people

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:06.102
that are going to be
getting their law degrees

00:08:06.102 --> 00:08:07.654
on Twitter and Facebook.

00:08:07.654 --> 00:08:09.450
You might not have heard,
but the Zuckerberg Law School

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:13.350
in Paolo Alto became an
accredited ABA law school,

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:15.610
so all of those people
who are pontificating

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:17.890
about legal subjects on social media,

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:20.790
they probably actually
have their law degrees now.

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:21.800
(laughs) Oh god.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:23.550
- Let's see what your best move is.

00:08:26.025 --> 00:08:27.190
(slapping)

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.563
- I'm looking forward to buying
a whole lot of new scotch.

00:08:30.563 --> 00:08:32.360
(chuckles) One of my favorite bars in DC,

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:35.000
Jack Rose, is weathering
the storm by selling

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:38.579
thousands of bottles of
antique and vintage scotch,

00:08:38.579 --> 00:08:40.520
and I think I'm just gonna buy all of it.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.630
Bill Thomas, please, please
save me some bottles.

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:44.680
I'm looking forward to all of the new

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:48.170
insane legal theories that
I'm going to have to research

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.206
and talk about during
this isolation period.

00:08:51.206 --> 00:08:55.170
You know, I thought when
Donald Trump became president

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:59.790
in 2017 that uh, that
alone was going to create

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.580
a whole bunch of new legal hypotheticals,

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:02.900
and that was definitely the case,

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:05.400
but (sighs) man,

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.950
there are a whole bunch of crazy things

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:09.319
that we never thought would ever happen

00:09:09.319 --> 00:09:11.070
that we have to figure
out the legality of,

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.800
and it's every day a new legal theory.

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:16.380
- This is a tough hurricane.

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:18.280
One of the wettest we've ever seen

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.740
from the standpoint of water.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:24.320
- And frankly, I'm looking forward to

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:28.520
the entire world coming
together for a common cause.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.920
This is the first time in my lifetime,

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.410
and maybe the last time
since the Apollo project

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:36.310
that it feels like everyone
is rallying together

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:39.980
against a common enemy, and
this isn't a common enemy

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:44.910
in the xenophobic sense or
even in the true wartime sense,

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:47.610
but there's something out
there and it affects everyone,

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:52.170
and every scientist in the
entire world is trying to fix it.

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:55.262
Things are dire right now, for sure,

00:09:55.262 --> 00:09:57.470
but they're not gonna stay that way,

00:09:57.470 --> 00:10:01.270
because humans are nothing if not clever.

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:03.340
This might be our finest hour,

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:07.040
and I'm happy to do
what I can to help out,

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.230
whether it's through making
stupid YouTube videos

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:13.505
or through helping out with charities,

00:10:13.505 --> 00:10:16.880
but I think we all owe
scientists and doctors

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.090
out there a debt of gratitude,

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:20.160
not only for what they're doing right now,

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.460
but what they're going to do,

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:26.350
because I think that,
to paraphrase Andy Weir,

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.040
I think we're gonna science
the (bleep) out of it.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.940
I think we're gonna
come out of this better.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.860
You know, there's light
at the end of the tunnel.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:34.901
So that is an update from Legal Eagle.

00:10:34.901 --> 00:10:38.340
I will see you all in court, as it were.

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:41.190
If you want a really low barrier to entry

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:42.530
way of providing to charity,

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:44.740
check out the link to Tab For A Cause.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.930
Send me a message in the
comments or on Twitter.

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:50.630
I'm going to be here,
what else do I have to do?

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:54.336
And thank you, to you the
viewers, the Legal Eagles.

00:10:54.336 --> 00:10:57.260
I get a lot of satisfaction
for doing this channel,

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:01.590
and I'm really grateful
for being in the position

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:05.060
that I am and you guys make it worth it.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.640
Hang in there, we'll get through this,

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:10.173
and I'll see you in court.

